<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81726" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-νεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bend forward and look round timidly.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				4.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>incline first to one side then to the other, sway</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Phgn.</u>
				808a15
			</span></i>; of a chariot, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφαξονέω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.40
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of lands, <i>slope,
				incline</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸν Νότον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					8.4.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τὴν ἑσπέραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.1.6
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν Ἰταλίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.1.5
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθὰ ἡ φύσις π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1431.35
			</span></i> (Messene, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>project</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				166.11
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περινενευκὼς σφυγμός</span> perh.
				<i>compressible</i> pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.479
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.86
			</span></i>.</div>
